 145:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) TriggerCallback                   : TIM Trigger Callback.
 146:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) TriggerHalfCpltCallback           : TIM Trigger half complete Callback.
 147:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) IC_CaptureCallback                : TIM Input Capture Callback.
 148:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) IC_CaptureHalfCpltCallback        : TIM Input Capture half complete Callback.
